384	  for (const c of rules().classes) h += `<p class="sub">${dot(c)} ${esc(clsName(c))}</p><div class="chips">${Object.entries(HAIRS).map(([k, x]) => { const own = isOwned(sc, 'hair', k); return `<button type="button" data-hair="${c}" data-v="${k}" aria-pressed="${G.S.plan.hair[c] === k}" class="${own ? '' : 'locked'}">${esc(nm(x))} <small>${own ? `⏱ ${x.min} min` : esc(t().buy(x.price))}</small></button>`; }).join('')}</div>`;
385	  sbody.innerHTML = h;
386	  bindNumChips(paintCostumes);
387	  for (const b of sbody.querySelectorAll('[data-cos]')) b.onclick = () => {
388	    const kind = b.dataset.kind, k = b.dataset.v, list = { outfit: OUTFITS, shoes: SHOES, acc: ACCS }[kind];
389	    if (!isOwned(sc, kind, k) && !buy(kind, k, list[k].price, nm(list[k]))) return;
390	    cos[b.dataset.cos] = k; afterCostume(N.cls);
391	  };
392	  for (const b of sbody.querySelectorAll('[data-col]')) b.onclick = () => { cos.color = b.dataset.col; afterCostume(N.cls); };
393	  for (const b of sbody.querySelectorAll('[data-hair]')) b.onclick = () => { const k = b.dataset.v; if (!isOwned(sc, 'hair', k) && !buy('hair', k, HAIRS[k].price, nm(HAIRS[k]))) return; G.S.plan.hair[b.dataset.hair] = k; afterCostume(b.dataset.hair); };
394	}
395	function afterCostume(cls) { for (const d of dancers) if (d.cls === cls) d.lookKey = ''; changed(); }
396	
397	/* ---------------- the dressing room ---------------- */
398	function paintBuild() {
399	  const sc = G.S.school, total = rules().classes.reduce((s, c) => s + CLS[c].n, 0), L = analyseLoge(sc, total), F = t().fx;
400	  let h = `<h3>${esc(t().schoolName)}</h3><input type="text" id="nameIn" maxlength="40" value="${esc(sc.name)}" placeholder="${esc(t().school)}">`;
401	  h += `<h2>${esc(t().buildH)}</h2>`;
402	  const lines = [L.postesRaw ? F.postes(L.postesRaw) : F.postesNone, F.rail(L.rail, L.railCap, total), F.seats(L.seats, total)];
403	  if (L.calm) lines.push(F.calm(L.calm));
404	  for (const k of ['water', 'fruit', 'fan', 'shoes', 'screen', 'sieste', 'doudous', 'barre', 'clock', 'music']) if (L[k]) lines.push(F[k]);
405	  if (L.clutter) lines.push(F.clutter);
406	  h += `<div class="fxbox"><b>${esc(t().fxH)}</b>${lines.map((x) => `<div>${esc(x)}</div>`).join('')}</div>`;
407	  for (const f of L.invalid) h += `<p class="hint warn">⚠️ ${esc(t().wallWarn(nm(PIECES[f.id])))}</p>`;
408	  if (G.pickedRoom !== 'dr') h += `<p class="hint">${esc(t().buildHint)}</p><button type="button" class="small" id="goDr">${esc(t().goLoge)}</button>`;
409	  else {
410	    h += `<p class="hint">${esc(t().buildHint)}</p>`;
411	    if (G.armed) h += `<div class="chips"><button type="button" id="rotArm">${esc(t().rotateKey)}</button><button type="button" id="cancelArm">${esc(t().cancel)}</button></div>`;
412	    if (G.selected) h += `<div class="chips"><button type="button" id="rotSel">${esc(t().rotate)}</button><button type="button" id="movSel">${esc(t().move)}</button><button type="button" id="delSel">${esc(t().remove)} · ${esc(nm(PIECES[G.selected.id]))}</button></div>`;
413	    h += `<div class="cat">${Object.entries(PIECES).map(([id, p]) => {
414	      const own = isOwned(sc, 'piece', id), tags = Object.entries(p.fx).map(([k, v]) => t().fxTag[k](v)).join(' · ') + (p.wall ? ` · ${t().wallTag}` : '');
415	      return `<button type="button" data-piece="${id}" aria-pressed="${G.armed && G.armed.id === id}" class="${own ? '' : 'locked'}"><span>${p.icon}</span>${esc(nm(p))}<small>${esc(own ? tags : `${t().buy(p.price)} · ${tags}`)}</small></button>`;
416	    }).join('')}</div>`;
417	  }
418	  sbody.innerHTML = h;
419	  const ni = sbody.querySelector('#nameIn'); ni.oninput = () => { sc.name = ni.value.slice(0, 40); save(); W.drawSign(schoolName()); hud(); };
420	  const gd = sbody.querySelector('#goDr'); if (gd) gd.onclick = () => pickRoom('dr');
421	  for (const b of sbody.querySelectorAll('[data-piece]')) b.onclick = () => {
422	    const id = b.dataset.piece; if (!isOwned(sc, 'piece', id) && !buy('piece', id, PIECES[id].price, nm(PIECES[id]))) return;
423	    G.armed = G.armed && G.armed.id === id ? null : { id, rot: PIECES[id].wall ? 0 : 0 }; G.selected = null; W.setGhost(null); W.showFurniture(); paintBuild();
424	  };
425	  const ra = sbody.querySelector('#rotArm'); if (ra) ra.onclick = rotateArmed;
426	  const ca = sbody.querySelector('#cancelArm'); if (ca) ca.onclick = cancelArmed;
427	  const rs = sbody.querySelector('#rotSel'); if (rs) rs.onclick = rotateSelected;
428	  const ms = sbody.querySelector('#movSel'); if (ms) ms.onclick = moveSelected;
429	  const ds = sbody.querySelector('#delSel'); if (ds) ds.onclick = removeSelected;
430	}
431	export function rotateArmed() { if (!G.armed) return; G.armed.rot = (G.armed.rot + 1) % 4; if (W.ghost.f) { const f = { ...W.ghost.f, rot: G.armed.rot }; showGhost(f); } }
432	export function rotateSelected() {
433	  const f = G.selected; if (!f) return; const old = { c: f.c, r: f.r, rot: f.rot }, cols = G.S.school.logeCols;
434	  f.rot = (f.rot + 1) % 4;
435	  if (!fits(f, G.S.school.furniture, cols, f)) { const fp = footprint(f); f.c = clamp(f.c, 0, cols - fp.w); f.r = clamp(f.r, 0, LOGE.rows - fp.d); if (!fits(f, G.S.school.furniture, cols, f)) Object.assign(f, old); }
436	  changed();
437	}
438	export function moveSelected() { const f = G.selected; if (!f) return; G.S.school.furniture = G.S.school.furniture.filter((x) => x !== f); G.armed = { id: f.id, rot: f.rot, was: f }; G.selected = null; W.showFurniture(); paintBuild(); }
439	export function removeSelected() { G.S.school.furniture = G.S.school.furniture.filter((x) => x !== G.selected); G.selected = null; changed(); }
440	function cancelArmed() { if (G.armed && G.armed.was) G.S.school.furniture.push(G.armed.was); G.armed = null; W.setGhost(null); changed(); }
441	function showGhost(f) { const cols = G.S.school.logeCols, ok = fits(f, G.S.school.furniture, cols); W.setGhost(f, !ok ? 'bad' : PIECES[f.id].wall && !againstWall(f, cols) ? 'warn' : 'ok'); }
442	export function hoverAt(x, y) {
443	  if (!G.armed || G.pickedRoom !== 'dr' || G.run) return;
444	  const tl = W.tileAt(W.groundAt(x, y)); if (!tl) { W.setGhost(null); return; }
445	  const cols = G.S.school.logeCols, fp = footprint({ id: G.armed.id, rot: G.armed.rot });
446	  const f = { id: G.armed.id, rot: G.armed.rot, c: clamp(tl.c - Math.floor((fp.w - 1) / 2), 0, cols - fp.w), r: clamp(tl.r - Math.floor((fp.d - 1) / 2), 0, LOGE.rows - fp.d) };
447	  const g = W.ghost.f; if (!g || g.c !== f.c || g.r !== f.r || g.rot !== f.rot || g.id !== f.id) showGhost(f);
448	}
449	export function tapAt(x, y) {
450	  if (G.run) return;
451	  if (G.tab === 'build' && G.pickedRoom === 'dr') {
452	    if (G.armed) { hoverAt(x, y); const g = W.ghost.f; if (g && fits(g, G.S.school.furniture, G.S.school.logeCols)) { const f = { id: g.id, c: g.c, r: g.r, rot: g.rot }; G.S.school.furniture.push(f); G.selected = f; if (G.armed.was) G.armed = null; W.setGhost(null); W.showFurniture(); changed(); hoverAt(x, y); } return; }
453	    const f = W.pieceAt(x, y); if (f) { G.selected = f; W.showFurniture(); paintBuild(); return; }
454	    if (G.selected) { G.selected = null; W.showFurniture(); paintBuild(); }
455	  }
456	  const g = W.groundAt(x, y); if (!g) return; const r = W.roomAt(g.x, g.z);
457	  const inside = g.x > -15 && g.x < W.ROOMS.dr.x1 && g.z > -9 && g.z < 7;
458	  if (!inside) { if (G.pickedRoom) pickRoom(null); return; }
459	  const room = r === 'wing' || r === 'stage' ? 'hall' : r; if (room !== G.pickedRoom) pickRoom(room);
460	}
461	// the little toolbar over a selected piece
462	export function placeFloat() {
463	  const f = G.selected;
464	  if (!f || G.run || G.tab !== 'build' || G.screen !== 'prep') { floatEl.hidden = true; return; }
465	  const fp = footprint(f), p = W.project(W.ROOMS.dr.x0 + f.c + fp.w / 2, 1.6, W.ROOMS.dr.z0 + f.r + fp.d / 2);
466	  if (p.behind) { floatEl.hidden = true; return; }
467	  if (floatEl.hidden || floatEl.dataset.for !== JSON.stringify(f)) {
468	    floatEl.innerHTML = `<button type="button" data-fl="rot" title="${esc(t().rotate)}">↻</button><button type="button" data-fl="mov" title="${esc(t().move)}">✥</button><button type="button" data-fl="del" title="${esc(t().remove)}">✕</button>`;
469	    floatEl.querySelector('[data-fl=rot]').onclick = rotateSelected; floatEl.querySelector('[data-fl=mov]').onclick = moveSelected; floatEl.querySelector('[data-fl=del]').onclick = removeSelected;
470	    floatEl.dataset.for = JSON.stringify(f); floatEl.hidden = false;

